    "updated_at": "2026-11-09T08:18:56Z",
    "body": "Resolved the conflict with upstream #442 in merge `b0ad73ec` (upstream/main merged into this branch):\n\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs`: kept this branch's `Cmd::View` tip (now mentions the machines pane) and added #442's new `Cmd::Theme` tip.\n- `crates/ui/src/state.rs`: kept #442's `ribbon_theme_open: false` and this branch's `PanelsOpen { browser: true, properties: true, machines: false }`.\n\nGate (`scripts/gate.sh quick upstream/main`, app + ui suites): all 14 pinning tests pass. The only reds are the known ones that also fail on main: the GPU headless tests (`headless_run_succeeds`, `headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`, `egui_headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`) and `setup_stock_source::a_new_block_after_a_flip_starts_from_its_own_stock_and_undoes` (#415, fixed by #420).\n\nThe branch now merges cleanly with main. Flagging ready again.\n",
